{"suttaId":"an6.95","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-vi","vriCode":"s0403m2.mul","paras":[778,782],"vripara":"95"},"segments":{"an6.95:0.3":"Catutthaabhabbaṭṭhānasuttaṃ","an6.95:1.1":"“Chayimāni, bhikkhave, abhabbaṭṭhānāni.","an6.95:1.2":"Katamāni cha?","an6.95:1.3":"Abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo sayaṃkataṃ sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ, abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo paraṃkataṃ [parakataṃ (sī. syā.)] sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ, abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo sayaṃkatañca paraṃkatañca sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ, abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo asayaṃkāraṃ adhiccasamuppannaṃ sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ, abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo aparaṃkāraṃ adhiccasamuppannaṃ sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ, abhabbo diṭṭhisampanno puggalo asayaṃkārañca aparaṃkārañca adhiccasamuppannaṃ sukhadukkhaṃ paccāgantuṃ.","an6.95:1.4":"Taṃ kissa hetu?","an6.95:1.5":"Tathā hissa, bhikkhave, diṭṭhisampannassa puggalassa hetu ca sudiṭṭho hetusamuppannā ca dhammā.","an6.95:1.6":"Imāni kho, bhikkhave, cha abhabbaṭṭhānānī”ti.","an6.95:1.7":"Ekādasamaṃ.","an6.95:1.8":"Sītivaggo navamo. [catuttho (syā. ka.)]","an6.95:2.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","an6.95:2.1":"Sītibhāvaṃ āvaraṇaṃ,","an6.95:2.2":"voropitā sussūsati;","an6.95:2.3":"Appahāya pahīnābhabbo,","an6.95:2.4":"taṭṭhānā caturopi cāti. 10."},"unsure":[],"preface":[],"attha":{"book":"Mp-vi","bookName":"Chakkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0403a.att","from":761,"to":764,"paras":[{"para":761,"vripara":"92-95","refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Aṭṭhame <b>anāgamanīyaṃ vatthu</b>nti anupagantabbaṃ kāraṇaṃ, pañcannaṃ verānaṃ dvāsaṭṭhiyā ca diṭṭhigatānametaṃ adhivacanaṃ.","<b>Aṭṭhamaṃ bhava</b>nti kāmāvacare aṭṭhamaṃ paṭisandhiṃ.","Navame <b>kotūhalamaṅgalenā</b>ti diṭṭhasutamutamaṅgalena.","Dasame <b>sayaṃkata</b>ntiādīni attadiṭṭhivasena vuttāni.","<b>Adhiccasamuppanna</b>nti ahetunibbattaṃ.","Sesaṃ sabbattha uttānamevāti."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":762,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Sītivaggo navamo. 10."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":763,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Ānisaṃsavaggo 1-2."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":764,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Pātubhāvasuttādivaṇṇanā 96-97."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Mp-t-vi","bookName":"Chakkanipāta-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0403t.tik","from":780,"to":784,"paras":[{"para":780,"vripara":"86-95","refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Dutiye <b>acchandiko</b>ti kattukamyatākusalacchandarahito.","Uttarakurukā manussā acchandikaṭṭhānaṃ paviṭṭhā.","<b>Duppañño</b>ti bhavaṅgapaññāya parihīno.","Bhavaṅgapaññāya pana paripuṇṇāyapi yassa bhavaṅgaṃ lokuttarassa paccayo na hoti, sopi duppañño eva nāma.","<b>Abhabbo niyāmaṃ okkamituṃ kusalesu dhammesu sammatta</b>nti kusalesu dhammesu sammattaniyāmasaṅkhātaṃ ariyamaggaṃ okkamituṃ adhigantuṃ abhabbo.","<b>Na kammāvaraṇatāyā</b>tiādīsu abhabbavipariyāyena attho veditabbo.","Catutthādīni uttānatthāni."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"],["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":781,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Āvaraṇasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":782,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Sītivaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā. 10."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":783,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Ānisaṃsavaggo 1-11."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]},{"para":784,"vripara":null,"refs":["an6.95:1"],"lines":["Pātubhāvasuttādivaṇṇanā 96-106."],"lineRefs":[["an6.95:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
